{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": { "json": "## Wildpaws Copilot Studio — Audit Activity\n\nLive view of Copilot Studio interactions captured from the Microsoft 365 Unified Audit Log (Purview) and streamed into `WildpawsCopilotAudit_CL` via the Logs Ingestion API.\n\n- **Source**: `Search-UnifiedAuditLog -RecordType CopilotInteraction`\n- **Pipeline**: Purview → `scripts/get-copilot-audit.ps1 -PushToSentinel` → DCE → DCR → LAW table\n- **Note**: Studio agents emit *metadata only* (user/agent/channel/thread). Prompt text, RAI verdict, and tokens require BYOM + Foundry diagnostic settings.\n" },
      "name": "title"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "tr-param",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "type": 4,
            "value": { "durationMs": 86400000 },
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                { "durationMs": 3600000 }, { "durationMs": 14400000 },
                { "durationMs": 86400000 }, { "durationMs": 259200000 },
                { "durationMs": 604800000 }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "params"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "WildpawsCopilotAudit_CL\n| summarize Invocations = count() by bin(TimeGenerated, 15m), AppHost\n| render timechart",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Invocations over time, by channel (AppHost)",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 0 },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "chart-by-channel"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "WildpawsCopilotAudit_CL\n| summarize Invocations = count(), Users = dcount(UserPrincipalName), LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated) by AgentName, AppHost\n| order by Invocations desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "By agent × channel",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 0 },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table"
      },
      "name": "by-agent"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "WildpawsCopilotAudit_CL\n| summarize Calls = count(), Agents = make_set(AgentName), LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated) by UserPrincipalName\n| top 25 by Calls",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Top users (last 24h)",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 0 },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table"
      },
      "name": "top-users"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "WildpawsCopilotAudit_CL\n| project TimeGenerated, UserPrincipalName, AgentName, AppHost, ClientIP, ClientRegion, ThreadId, AuditRecordId\n| order by TimeGenerated desc\n| take 100",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Recent interactions",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 0 },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table"
      },
      "name": "recent"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "WildpawsCopilotAudit_CL\n| summarize Sources = make_set(ClientRegion), Calls = count() by ClientIP\n| top 20 by Calls",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Client IP × region (anomaly hunting)",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 0 },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table"
      },
      "name": "client-ip"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": { "json": "### Tool Invocation Health (existing)\nBelow panels query the `fn_Wildpaws_Tool()` function for connector tool calls (success/fail/duration)." },
      "name": "tool-section-title"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "fn_Wildpaws_Tool()\n| summarize Calls = count() by bin(TimeGenerated, 15m), success\n| render timechart",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Tool call success vs failure over time",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 0 },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "tool-success"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "fn_Wildpaws_Tool()\n| summarize Calls = count(), p50 = percentile(duration_ms, 50), p95 = percentile(duration_ms, 95), Failures = countif(success == false) by tool_name, channel_id\n| order by Calls desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Tools — calls, latency, failures",
        "timeContext": { "durationMs": 0 },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table"
      },
      "name": "tool-table"
    }
  ],
  "$schema": "https://github.com/Microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/schema/workbook.json"
}
